{"seq":3,"slug":"late-pledge-address-change","title":"Late Pledge、加购变更与地址修改的处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdfunding-reward-fulfillment/reward-tier-pledge/late-pledge-address-change","wordCount":2816,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"late-pledge-加购变更与地址修改的处理\">Late Pledge、加购变更与地址修改的处理</h1><p>众筹项目在截止那一刻&quot;达标&quot;并不意味着承诺就冻结了。恰恰相反：活动结束后才进入履约压力最大的阶段——一批从未在活动页面上出现过的人会通过 late pledge 涌进来，已经认投的人会反复加购、减购、换地址，而这些变更全部发生在一个<strong>货物还没造出来</strong>的时间窗口里。把这段窗口管理好，履约系统就能平滑地把&quot;可变的承诺&quot;收敛成&quot;不可变的运单&quot;；管理不好，就会出现同一支持者收到两个互相矛盾的拣货单、或者面单打到了三年前的旧地址。这一篇处理这段可变窗口：late pledge 的收单语义、加购变更的计价与并发、地址修改的时点与不可逆点，以及让三者共享同一套审计骨架的数据模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>众筹履约的前台几乎从不由众筹平台承担。以 Kickstarter 为例，它收 5% 平台费、支付处理另收 3–5%，采用 all-or-nothing（未达标不收款）模型（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kickstarter\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kickstarter</a> ），但<strong>不在活动结束后继续收款</strong>。真正承接 late pledge、加购、地址收集与运费的，是 <strong>pledge manager</strong>（认投管理器）这一独立角色——BackerKit 自 2012 年起即提供认投管理、支付处理、运输与预售工具（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BackerKit\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BackerKit</a> ），同类还有 PledgeManager、Gamefound 的 late pledge、PledgeBox 等。这是理解本主题的前提：<strong>late pledge 阶段的资金走 pledge manager 的通道，不经过众筹平台，也不参与达标判定。</strong></p>\n<p>于是&quot;承诺&quot;在本阶段被拆成三个可以独立变化的部分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部分</th>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>可变原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>认投主体</td>\n<td>一条 pledge</td>\n<td>late pledge 新增、取消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认投内容</td>\n<td>pledge 行项（档位 + 加购项）</td>\n<td>加购、减购、换档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交付去向</td>\n<td>收货地址</td>\n<td>搬家、填错、换目的国</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三者的变更窗口<strong>不是同一个</strong>。加购能不能改取决于该行项是否已分配进某个发货批次；地址能不能改取决于该批次是否已锁定地址；late pledge 能不能进取决于窗口是否开启。把它们当成一个&quot;订单可否编辑&quot;的布尔值，是这段流程里最常见的建模错误。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;活动截止&lt;br/&gt;达标判定冻结&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;导入 backer 报表&lt;br/&gt;建立 pledge 底账&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;发送 survey&lt;br/&gt;收集地址与加购&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;Late pledge 窗口&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|开启| E[&quot;接受 late pledge&lt;br/&gt;与加购付款&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|关闭| F[&quot;停止收单&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;批次规划&lt;br/&gt;行项分配到 ship_batch&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;地址锁定&lt;br/&gt;生成地址快照&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;拣货打包 -&gt; 打印面单 -&gt; 出货 -&gt; 妥投&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"活动截止&lt;br/&gt;达标判定冻结\"] --&gt; B[\"导入 backer 报表&lt;br/&gt;建立 pledge 底账\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"发送 survey&lt;br/&gt;收集地址与加购\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"Late pledge 窗口\"}\n    D --&gt;|开启| E[\"接受 late pledge&lt;br/&gt;与加购付款\"]\n    D --&gt;|关闭| F[\"停止收单\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"批次规划&lt;br/&gt;行项分配到 ship_batch\"]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[\"地址锁定&lt;br/&gt;生成地址快照\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"拣货打包 -&gt; 打印面单 -&gt; 出货 -&gt; 妥投\"]</pre><p>C 到 G 之间的整段是<strong>可变窗口</strong>：任何变更都只在这段内生效。G 之后的每一次修改都不再是&quot;改数据&quot;，而是一次有成本的补救动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"late-pledge-的窗口与资金语义\">Late Pledge 的窗口与资金语义</h2><h3 id=\"它是一笔新交易-不是一条旧-pledge-的编辑\">它是一笔新交易，不是一条旧 pledge 的编辑</h3><p>late pledge 的正确建模是<strong>新增一条来源为 <code>LATE</code> 的 pledge</strong>，而不是去改活动期间那条。原因有三层：活动 pledge 的金额在截止时刻已作为不可变事件参与达标判定，改写会污染那个被冻结的事实；late pledge 通常按当前价目（而非当时的早鸟价）成交；退款与纠纷要能区分&quot;因项目失败退款&quot;和&quot;late pledge 未发货退款&quot;，两者合同基础不同。</p>\n<p>因此 pledge 表需要来源字段（<code>source ∈ {CAMPAIGN, LATE, MANUAL}</code>）和一条针对 late pledge 的去重约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_pledge_late_dedup&#10;  ON pledge (campaign_id, user_id)&#10;  WHERE source = &#39;LATE&#39; AND state &lt;&gt; &#39;CANCELLED&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_pledge_late_dedup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pledge (campaign_id, user_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LATE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CANCELLED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是业务约束的数据库表达：同一支持者在同一项目中只应有一条活跃的 late pledge。没有它，用户在 survey 页面刷新一次就可能多付一份钱——这是 late pledge 最典型的一类资金事故。</p>\n<h3 id=\"窗口关闭必须是一次性-可审计的事件\">窗口关闭必须是一次性、可审计的事件</h3><p>late pledge 窗口的开关不该是可随时翻转的：关闭时刻决定了&quot;哪些付款算数&quot;，若被管理员手工改来改去，对账就失去基准。关闭动作应写入一条带时间戳的事件并由调度器执行。窗口关闭后到达的付款必须是<strong>明确可查的两种结局之一</strong>：已拒绝并全额退回，或被人工登记为 <code>MANUAL</code> 来源。绝不允许它静默地躺在支付通道里——这类悬空款项在季末对账时表现为一笔无法归属的收入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加购变更的计价与并发\">加购变更的计价与并发</h2><h3 id=\"加购是独立行项-不是一个金额增量\">加购是独立行项，不是一个金额增量</h3><p>加购（add-on）的常见实现错误，是在 pledge 上记一个 <code>addon_amount</code> 数字。后果是：无法知道用户加购了什么，因而无法装箱（装箱需要知道实物项）、无法按重量算运费、无法对单件退款。正确的结构是行项表，每行有独立的类型、数量与状态，并携带它的批次归属：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE pledge_line (&#10;  line_id    BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  pledge_id  BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES pledge(pledge_id),&#10;  kind       TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (kind IN (&#39;TIER&#39;,&#39;ADDON&#39;,&#39;DIGITAL&#39;)),&#10;  sku_id     BIGINT,&#10;  qty        INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK (qty &gt; 0),&#10;  unit_price NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL CHECK (unit_price &gt;= 0),&#10;  batch_id   BIGINT,&#10;  state      TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (state IN&#10;               (&#39;PLANNED&#39;,&#39;ALLOCATED&#39;,&#39;PICKING&#39;,&#39;SHIPPED&#39;,&#39;CANCELLED&#39;))&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pledge_line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pledge_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pledge(pledge_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  kind       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TIER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ADDON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DIGITAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (unit_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  batch_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">               (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PLANNED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ALLOCATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PICKING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SHIPPED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CANCELLED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>加购变更的守卫条件因此是&quot;该行项所在批次的状态&quot;，不是一个全局锁单标志。</p>\n<h3 id=\"补款与退款都要重算三笔钱\">补款与退款都要重算三笔钱</h3><p>加购不是只改货款：一次加购会同时改变货款、运费与税，跨境场景下三者都不可忽略：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Delta</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>货款</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>ship</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>运费</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>tax</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>dest</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>base</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>税</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Delta} = \\underbrace{\\Delta\\!\\left(\\sum_i p_i n_i\\right)}_{\\text{货款}} + \\underbrace{\\Delta \\text{ship}(w, z)}_{\\text{运费}} + \\underbrace{\\Delta \\text{tax}(\\text{dest}, \\text{base})}_{\\text{税}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Delta</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.354em;vertical-align:-2.604em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.146em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.75em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">货款</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.75em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-1.8243em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.75em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.9257em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.604em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">运费</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ship</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">税</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tax</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dest</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中运费由<strong>总重量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 与目的地区域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 共同决定（pledge manager 的运费表普遍按&quot;重量分档 × 目的地区域&quot;计价），因此加购一件肩带可能把整单推进更高一档运费，而不是简单加一个固定值。只按货款差价开补款单，是跨境众筹里最常见的少收/多退来源。</p>\n<p>三笔钱的重算必须是<strong>一次原子操作</strong>：先按新的行项集合算出 <code>Delta</code>，把补款或退款作为一条独立记录写入，然后才允许支付通道扣款或退款。把&quot;改行项&quot;和&quot;收差价&quot;分成两个独立请求，会造成行项已改但钱没收到的悬空状态。</p>\n<p>变更流程有两条硬分支。其一，<strong>支付未成功就不能提交变更</strong>，否则用户白拿一件货；失败或超时都保留旧行项并转入对账。其二，并发请求用乐观锁挡住——两条同时到达的加购请求各自读到同一 <code>version</code>，只有一条能提交，另一条重读后基于新版本重算。让数据库的 <code>UPDATE ... WHERE version = ?</code> 裁决，比在应用层加锁更可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地址修改-快照-锁批与不可逆点\">地址修改：快照、锁批与不可逆点</h2><h3 id=\"地址不是一个字段-是一条带版本的时间线\">地址不是一个字段，是一条带版本的时间线</h3><p>把地址理解成 pledge 上的三个文本字段，会在第一次发货后就出事：支持者改地址，历史运单的地址也跟着变了，&quot;这批货到底发到哪&quot;再也无法追溯。正确的模型是把地址存成<strong>不可变快照</strong>：<code>address_snapshot(pledge_id, version, country_code, line1, ..., is_current)</code> 每版本一行且只有一个 <code>is_current</code> 为真，<code>batch_address_lock(batch_id, pledge_id, snapshot_id)</code> 记录批次锁定时的快照。改地址即插入新版本并把旧版本置假，<strong>旧版本永不删除</strong>。面单打印读取的是锁批指向的快照而非&quot;当前地址&quot;，因此任何一次历史发货都能精确复现当时的投递去向。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个不可逆点决定改址的代价\">三个不可逆点决定改址的代价</h3><p>改地址的可行性不由&quot;是否发货&quot;这一个条件决定，而由依次到达的不可逆点决定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点</th>\n<th>系统状态</th>\n<th>可行方式</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>锁批前</td>\n<td>无地址快照</td>\n<td>直接插入新地址版本</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锁批后、面单打印前</td>\n<td>有快照</td>\n<td>作废锁批，重新锁批</td>\n<td>低（人工核对）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面单打印后、出货前</td>\n<td>面单已生成</td>\n<td>承运商拦截 / 作废面单</td>\n<td>中（承运商费用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途 / 妥投后</td>\n<td>运单生效或已签收</td>\n<td>目的地改派、退回重发（等同新订单）</td>\n<td>高 / 最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因此系统的可编辑判定是一个针对<strong>批次</strong>的函数，而不是针对订单的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>editable</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>state</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>PLANNED</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>ALLOCATED</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∄</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>batch_address_lock</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{editable}(b, p) = \\big[\\, b.\\text{state} \\in \\{\\text{PLANNED}, \\text{ALLOCATED}\\} \\,\\wedge\\, \\nexists\\, \\text{batch\\_address\\_lock}(b, p) \\,\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">editable</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">state</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PLANNED</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ALLOCATED</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">batch_address_lock</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它与加购的守卫条件（行项批次状态）是<strong>两条独立的判据</strong>：地址可以在加购已锁定之后仍可改，反之亦然。把两者合并成一个&quot;锁单&quot;概念会同时损害两端——要么地址改得太早被误锁，要么加购改得太晚打乱拣货。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跨境地址的特殊约束\">跨境地址的特殊约束</h3><p>改地址在跨境场景下不止是物流问题。目的国变更会连带改变关税归属、合规要求与清关申报所需的单据，因此更稳妥的实现是<strong>只允许改同一目的国内部的地址</strong>，跨目的国的请求转人工评估。地址在写入时要做标准化校验：国家代码用 ISO 3166-1 alpha-2，州/省用目的国标准细分代码，邮编按各国格式校验——可参考万国邮政联盟（UPU）的地址规范与各国邮政的地址验证服务（如 USPS 地址标准化）。地址不完整是清关失败与退回的首要原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变更的数据模型与审计\">变更的数据模型与审计</h2><p>把上述三块收敛，共享的骨架是一张<strong>变更请求表</strong>加&quot;变更即事件&quot;的写入纪律：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pledge</td>\n<td>source, state, version</td>\n<td>认投主体，乐观锁版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pledge_line</td>\n<td>kind, sku_id, qty, batch_id, state</td>\n<td>内容与批次归属</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>address_snapshot</td>\n<td>version, is_current</td>\n<td>地址的不可变时间线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>batch_address_lock</td>\n<td>batch_id, snapshot_id</td>\n<td>批次用到哪个地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>change_request</td>\n<td>type, idempotency_key, state</td>\n<td>变更意图与结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>change_request</code> 的幂等键由 <code>{pledge_id}:{type}:{payload_hash}</code> 构成，唯一索引保证同一意图重复提交只落一条——<strong>幂等放在数据层，而不是靠应用层去重</strong>。</p>\n<p>变更的执行顺序在任何情况下都是：<strong>先校验守卫条件 → 再算资金 → 资金成功 → 最后提交数据变更</strong>。反过来（先改数据再收钱）会制造&quot;已享受权益但未付款&quot;的不可回收状态；正确顺序则最坏只是钱收了而变更因并发冲突回滚，可以重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-late-pledge-是一次-新交易-而非旧-pledge-的编辑-用-source-区分-且不参与已冻结的达标判定-众筹平台通常不承接它-实际由-pledge-manager-承接并收款-backerkit-自-2012-年起提供此类工具\">小结- late pledge 是一次<strong>新交易</strong>而非旧 pledge 的编辑，用 <code>source</code> 区分，且不参与已冻结的达标判定；众筹平台通常不承接它，实际由 pledge manager 承接并收款（BackerKit 自 2012 年起提供此类工具）。</h2><ul>\n<li>late pledge 窗口的关闭是一次性、可审计的事件；窗口外的付款必须有明确结局，不能悬空。</li>\n<li>加购是独立行项，一次加购同时改变货款、运费与税，补款单必须重算三笔钱；守卫条件是&quot;行项所在批次状态&quot;，用乐观锁 + 幂等键挡住并发与重复提交。</li>\n<li>地址是带版本的不可变快照时间线，面单读取的是批次锁定的快照而非&quot;当前地址&quot;；改址成本由不可逆点分级，可编辑判定针对批次而非订单。</li>\n<li>跨境改址要区分&quot;同国内部改址&quot;与&quot;改目的国&quot;；变更的执行顺序恒为校验守卫 → 算资金 → 资金成功 → 提交数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本篇处理的是承诺在履约前的可变性；当承诺收敛为行项与快照之后，下一步就是把这些行项展开成可装箱的实物单元，见 <a href=\"../reward-pack-ship/tier-bom-package-combine\">档位 BOM、包材规格与多档合并发货</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Late Pledge、加购变更与地址修改的处理","id":"late-pledge-加购变更与地址修改的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Late Pledge 的窗口与资金语义","id":"late-pledge-的窗口与资金语义"},{"level":3,"text":"它是一笔新交易，不是一条旧 pledge 的编辑","id":"它是一笔新交易-不是一条旧-pledge-的编辑"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口关闭必须是一次性、可审计的事件","id":"窗口关闭必须是一次性-可审计的事件"},{"level":2,"text":"加购变更的计价与并发","id":"加购变更的计价与并发"},{"level":3,"text":"加购是独立行项，不是一个金额增量","id":"加购是独立行项-不是一个金额增量"},{"level":3,"text":"补款与退款都要重算三笔钱","id":"补款与退款都要重算三笔钱"},{"level":2,"text":"地址修改：快照、锁批与不可逆点","id":"地址修改-快照-锁批与不可逆点"},{"level":3,"text":"地址不是一个字段，是一条带版本的时间线","id":"地址不是一个字段-是一条带版本的时间线"},{"level":3,"text":"三个不可逆点决定改址的代价","id":"三个不可逆点决定改址的代价"},{"level":3,"text":"跨境地址的特殊约束","id":"跨境地址的特殊约束"},{"level":2,"text":"变更的数据模型与审计","id":"变更的数据模型与审计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结- late pledge 是一次**新交易**而非旧 pledge 的编辑，用 `source` 区分，且不参与已冻结的达标判定；众筹平台通常不承接它，实际由 pledge manager 承接并收款（BackerKit 自 2012 年起提供此类工具）。","id":"小结-late-pledge-是一次-新交易-而非旧-pledge-的编辑-用-source-区分-且不参与已冻结的达标判定-众筹平台通常不承接它-实际由-pledge-manager-承接并收款-backerkit-自-2012-年起提供此类工具"}],"prev":{"title":"Pledge Manager 问卷、收货信息收集与认投数据导出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdfunding-reward-fulfillment/reward-tier-pledge/pledge-manager-survey-export"},"next":{"title":"档位 BOM、包材规格与多档合并发货","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdfunding-reward-fulfillment/reward-pack-ship/tier-bom-package-combine"}}